@page "/"

<PageTitle>FreelanceHub</PageTitle>

<h1>Welcome to FreelanceHub</h1>

<p>A GraphQL-powered freelance marketplace.</p>

<h2>GraphQL Endpoint</h2>
<p>Access the GraphQL endpoint at: <code>/graphql</code></p>

<h3>Available Operations:</h3>

<h4>Mutations:</h4>
<ul>
    <li><strong>register</strong> - Create a new user account</li>
    <li><strong>login</strong> - Authenticate and receive a JWT token</li>
    <li><strong>createProject</strong> - Post a new project (requires authentication)</li>
    <li><strong>createBid</strong> - Submit a bid on a project (requires authentication)</li>
    <li><strong>updateProjectStatus</strong> - Update project status (requires authentication)</li>
</ul>

<h4>Queries:</h4>
<ul>
    <li><strong>projects</strong> - List all projects with filtering and sorting</li>
    <li><strong>project(id)</strong> - Get a specific project with bids</li>
    <li><strong>users</strong> - List users (requires authentication)</li>
    <li><strong>bids(projectId)</strong> - Get bids for a project</li>
</ul>

<h3>Example Mutations:</h3>

<h4>Register:</h4>
<pre><code>mutation {
  register(email: "user@example.com", password: "password123", name: "John Doe") {
    token
    user {
      id
      email
      name
    }
  }
}</code></pre>

<h4>Login:</h4>
<pre><code>mutation {
  login(email: "user@example.com", password: "password123") {
    token
    user {
      id
      email
      name
    }
  }
}</code></pre>

<h4>Create Project (with Authorization header):</h4>
<pre><code>mutation {
  createProject(
    title: "Build a Website"
    description: "Need a modern website built"
    budget: 5000
  ) {
    id
    title
    budget
    status
  }
}</code></pre>

<h4>Create Bid (with Authorization header):</h4>
<pre><code>mutation {
  createBid(
    projectId: 1
    amount: 4500
    proposal: "I can build this website for you"
  ) {
    id
    amount
    proposal
  }
}</code></pre>

<h3>Example Queries:</h3>

<h4>Get All Projects:</h4>
<pre><code>query {
  projects {
    id
    title
    description
    budget
    status
    owner {
      name
      email
    }
    bids {
      amount
      bidder {
        name
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre>

<h4>Get Specific Project:</h4>
<pre><code>query {
  project(id: 1) {
    id
    title
    description
    budget
    status
    owner {
      name
    }
    bids {
      amount
      proposal
      bidder {
        name
        email
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre>